# Secrets. .env.example documents names only and IS tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# NOTE: docs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. CLAUDE.md §2 names
# docs/architecture.md and docs/deployment-strategy.md as the project's source
# of truth, and a source of truth that a fresh clone cannot read is not one.
# Do not add a docs/ pattern here — several Python and Node .gitignore
# templates ship one for Sphinx or generated API docs, and it would silently
# untrack the design documents.

# A fuller ignore file (Python, Node, Docker, editor artefacts) lands with the
# M0 repository skeleton.
